        "Set \"Max lines\" to trigger an alert when a specified lines-per-second threshold is exceeded.",
        "Review the \"Max lines\" threshold as the average index rate changes over time.",
        "Adjust the \"Max lines\" threshold as the average index rate changes over time.",
        "Use \"Max z-score\" alerts to monitor anomalous flow rates.",
        "Use \"Max z-score\" alerts to control anomalous flow rates.",
        "Optionally configure a custom alert schedule.",
        "A custom alert schedule specifies the days and hours for alerts triggered by exceeded thresholds.",
        "Individual recipients can mute alert emails."
    ]
}
